{
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.Defeated.WithAFinal": "With a final strike, the sword shatters into five pieces. You approach the remains of the holy sword, and notice a distinct humming sound coming from the shards. It seems they still possess a measure of power."
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.Eviscerate.ShortlyThereafterThe": "\nShortly thereafter, the area struck by the phantom blade bursts open in a gaping wound. You're bleeding!"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.Eviscerate.TheSliceStrikes": "The slice strikes you painfully, completely phasing through your defenses!"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.Eviscerate.TheSwordTakes": "The sword takes on a pale blue glow, becoming ethereal, and strikes at you!"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.Eviscerate.YouManageTo": "You manage to dodge the sword's enhanced attack in the nick of time."
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.HolyLight.TheSwordFlies": "The sword flies away from you, towards the sky. You look upwards, and it starts shining brightly. Before you can look away, it flashes powerfully, as if it became the sun itself!"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.HolyLight.TheVeryLight": "[pg]The very light it emanates burns your skin, a result of its regained power acting against your corruption!"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.HolyLight.YouBlinkJust": "You blink just in time. The effect is nothing more than mild disorientation."
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.HolyLight.YouCanT": "You can't shut your eyes in time; you're <b>blinded</b>!"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.Purge.HeHoldsThe": "[pg]He holds the sword aloft as it glows with blinding brightness, and thrusts at you, releasing a beam of pure light!"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.Purge.TheBeamStrikes": "\nThe beam strikes through your, burning you with unimaginable intensity."
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.Purge.TheSwordPositions": "The sword positions itself as if it was sheathed. Shortly afterwards, a blue specter, in the shape of an armored knight, appears from the ether by the sword's side, and wields the blade!"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.Purge.YouFeelYour": "\nYou feel your corruption and lust burning away as the beam continues to strike through you."
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.Purge.YouManageTo": "\nYou manage to narrowly dodge the beam of light."
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.Text": " [b:Critical hit!]"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.You01": "You {0} {1}, denting it!"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.YouCrack0": "You crack {0} with your powerful {1}!"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.YouStagger0": "You stagger {0} with the force of your {1}!"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.YouStrikeA": "You strike a glancing blow on {0}!"
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.Your0Connects": "Your {0} connects, but doesn't harm {1}."
  "Combat.BeautifulSwordFight.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.Zero": "{0}"
}
